                                "sense_id": "39b7b6d3-dae3-30fd-b7bc-10325a3f7ef4",
                                "text": "The grass was now long and green upon Guido's grave, and filled with small, pale wild flowers. A heavy cloud rested over the inclosed space, where the black yews waved dismally; while, far away, the sunshine reposed on the distant height."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc7a9167-7e1e-470d-b60b-027c4623286e",
                                "sense_id": "39b7b6d3-dae3-30fd-b7bc-10325a3f7ef4",
                                "text": "Then dots of white and black told him there were cattle of other colors in this inclosed valley."
                            }
                        ]
